<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head>
<%- include('partials/head', { pageTitle: '修改密码' }) %>
</head><body>
<%- include('partials/nav', { current: 'password', adminName: adminName }) %>
<div class="wrap">
  <h1 class="page-title">修改密码</h1>
  <div class="page-sub">当前账号：<b><%= adminName %></b></div>

  <% if (flash.success) { %><div class="alert alert-ok">✅ <%= flash.success %></div><% } %>
  <% if (flash.error) { %><div class="alert alert-error">⚠️ <%= flash.error %></div><% } %>

  <div class="card" style="max-width:560px">
    <div class="card-body">
      <form method="post" action="/admin/password">
        <div style="margin-bottom:16px">
          <label>当前密码</label>
          <input type="password" name="old_password" placeholder="请输入当前使用的密码" required autocomplete="current-password" />
        </div>
        <div style="margin-bottom:16px">
          <label>新密码（至少 8 位）</label>
          <input type="password" name="new_password" placeholder="建议字母+数字+符号组合" minlength="8" required autocomplete="new-password" />
        </div>
        <div style="margin-bottom:22px">
          <label>确认新密码</label>
          <input type="password" name="new_password2" placeholder="再次输入新密码" minlength="8" required autocomplete="new-password" />
        </div>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" style="padding:11px 30px">确认修改</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="alert alert-info" style="max-width:560px">
    🔐 <b>为什么必须改密码</b><br>
    默认密码 <code>admin / 123456</code> 极易被猜到。一旦有人登录后台，他可以查看全部用户数据、删除用户与识别记录、修改知识库。
    建议改成 <b>8 位以上、含大小写字母与数字</b>的密码，并定期更换。
  </div>
</div>
</body></html>
